      "name": "Clone Globoplay",
      "description": "Renames the package to com.globo.globotv.mod and the launcher label to \"Globoplay Mod\" so the patched app installs alongside the stock app with its own data and login. Expected limits: Google sign-in, Play Billing, Firebase (including Remote Config) and Play Integrity are keyed to the original package name and signature and may not work in the clone.",
